' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' COMPOSITION & DEPENDENCY RELATIONSHIPS
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
DesktopLauncher --> Main : launches
DesktopLauncher --> Lwjgl3Application : uses
DesktopLauncher --> Lwjgl3ApplicationConfiguration : uses

Main --> MainMenu : creates
Main --> Music : manages

' Battle Systems
ArcadeBattleScreen --> ArcadeMode : uses
ArcadeBattleScreen --> Character : controls (player)
ArcadeBattleScreen --> Character : controls (enemy)
ArcadeBattleScreen --> CalculateScore : calculates score

EndlessBattleScreen --> EndlessMode : uses
EndlessBattleScreen --> Character : controls (player)
EndlessBattleScreen --> Character : controls (enemy)
EndlessBattleScreen --> CalculateScore : calculates score

PVCBattleScreen --> PVCMode : uses CPU AI
PVCBattleScreen --> Character : controls (player)
PVCBattleScreen --> Character : controls (CPU)
PVCBattleScreen --> CalculateScore : calculates score

PVPBattleScreen --> PVPMode : handles PVP rules
PVPBattleScreen --> Character : controls (player1)
PVPBattleScreen --> Character : controls (player2)
PVPBattleScreen --> CalculateScore : calculates score

' Leaderboard
LeaderboardScreen --> Leaderboard : reads/displays
Leaderboard --> PlayerScore : contains

' Character System
BaseBattleScreen --> Character : creates
Character --> Skill : has 3

