' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' NOTES
' ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
note right of BaseBattleScreen
  Abstract base for all battle screens.
  Handles: rendering, turn logic, combat flow.
  Subclasses implement mode-specific behavior.
end note

note right of Mode
  Abstract progression logic for game modes.
  Manages enemy queues and win conditions.
  Subclasses: ArcadeMode, EndlessMode.
end note

note right of Character
  Base class for all 9 game characters.
  Manages: HP, Mana, Skills, combat stats.
end note

note right of Leaderboard
  File-based score persistence.
  Files: arcade_scores.txt, endless_scores.txt,
  pvc_scores.txt, pvp_scores.txt.
  Keeps top 10 per mode.
end note

note right of CalculateScore
  Static utility for score calculations.
  Different formulas per game mode.
  Called before saving to leaderboard.
end note

@enduml
